[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18186.788, "timestamp": "05:03:06", "text": "毁掉一个人的一生只需要一秒钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18188.39, "timestamp": "05:03:08", "text": "致 CL。但是，嘿，有些人就是想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18189.99, "timestamp": "05:03:09", "text": "她不假思索地看着丈夫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18193.19, "timestamp": "05:03:13", "text": "问责制。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18196.628, "timestamp": "05:03:16", "text": "说实话，这很令人难过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18204.55, "timestamp": "05:03:24", "text": "我的做法是完全不和孩子说话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18209.03, "timestamp": "05:03:29", "text": "是的，说实话，我当时真的不知道还有别的选择。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18211.03, "timestamp": "05:03:31", "text": "当时。我当时就想，“哦，在线"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18213.59, "timestamp": "05:03:33", "text": "朋友。”而那时，我们却不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18216.948, "timestamp": "05:03:36", "text": "聊聊我们的年龄之类的。不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18220.31, "timestamp": "05:03:40", "text": "呃，所以我没太在意。我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18222.31, "timestamp": "05:03:42", "text": "“哦，好朋友。我们要谈谈。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18224.868, "timestamp": "05:03:44", "text": "我的这个那个。”然后随着时间的推移，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18234.708, "timestamp": "05:03:54", "text": "嗯，事情就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18237.27, "timestamp": "05:03:57", "text": "是的。"}]